      "set": "week",
      "input_id": "gnews:0e3cbf453958ce83fabf7a65",
      "title": "Nvidia and Palantir Are Bringing Sovereign AI to the U.S. Government. Here's How.",
      "publication_day": "2026-07-06",
      "items": [
        {
          "span": "Nvidia ( NVDA +2.48% ) and Palantir Technologies ( PLTR +1.34% ) announced a collaboration designed to bring powerful open AI models into highly sensitive, classified environments.",
          "kind": 2,
          "weight_current": "supporting",
          "weight_proposed": "supporting",
          "depends_on": [],
          "tier": "fact",
          "who": "NVIDIA and Palantir (joint announcement, reported by The Motley Fool)",
          "driver": "需求",
          "meaning": {
            "who": "Palantir with NVIDIA",
            "what": "Palantir's new intelligence engine on its Sovereign AI Operating System deploys NVIDIA Nemotron open models inside US government agencies' own classified environments, on NVIDIA accelerated computing and AI Enterprise",
            "status": "happened (announced; no amount)"
          },
          "rule": "§5.1 第 2 类例'一家软件公司把本公司的模型集成进政府系统'（有名字，没金额也留，D240）；§6.3 表中同一例 → 辅助；§6.1 辅助",
          "was": "rejected in reference_v2 (the Palantir collaboration without size)",
          "weight": "supporting"
        }
      ],
      "not_kept": [
        {
          "span": "The U.S. government civilian workforce is around 2 million employees across critical sectors",
          "row": "记者的背景和框架（不是 NVIDIA 的量）",
          "depends_on": [],
          "weight": "not_kept"
        },
        {
          "span": "Palantir's and Nvidia's focus on one of the largest customer bases -- the public sector -- in regulated AI suggests a sizable and durable market opportunity",
          "row": "作者没有推导的看法",
          "depends_on": [],
          "weight": "not_kept"
        },
        {
          "span": "Closed models carry the risk of unintended data leakage, while fully open models that lack stringent deployment protocols often lack the security and audit features needed for regulated use.",
          "row": "记者的背景和框架（通用的技术讲解）",
          "depends_on": [],
          "weight": "not_kept"
        },
        {
          "span": "Palantir's Foundry suite manages large-scale data integration, while its Apollo platform handles the orchestration and ongoing management of deployed models across environments.",
          "row": "没有业务规模的产品细节",
          "depends_on": [],
          "weight": "not_kept"
        },
        {
          "span": "For national security and technological leadership, the ability to deploy flexible AI at scale in sensitive environments represents a meaningful strategic edge for the U.S. government.",
          "row": "没有数字也没有决定的战略表态（作者）",
          "depends_on": [],
          "weight": "not_kept"
        }
      ],
      "questions": {
        "must_open": [],
        "may_open": [],
        "must_not": [
          {
            "gist": "Will sovereign AI for the US government become a material NVIDIA revenue line?",
            "rule": "§4.2 测试 3：没有日期、没有可核对的量；作者自己说'business impact … is hard to predict'"
          },
          {
            "gist": "A Palantir question",
            "rule": "§3.2：Palantir 自己的量是 Palantir 的问题，本文没有它的量；§4.2 测试 1"
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": []
    },
