            "how_much": "more than 12 months",
            "period": "from 2027 to 2028",
            "status": "claim"
          },
          "rule": "§6.1 核心 关键产品进度; §6.3 确定状态「推迟到某个日期了」",
          "was": "core",
          "weight": "core"
        },
        {
          "span": "An Nvidia representative responded with a short statement to Tom's Hardware : \"Our roadmap is intact.\"",
          "also": [
