          "was": "core",
          "weight": "core"
        },
        {
          "span": "Nvidia is also understood to have killed NVL72x2, a stopgap rack designed to tide customers over, and that no proven alternative is now available to widen Rubin Ultra's scale-up in 2027.",
          "also": [
